# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee1.rpy:13
translate italian mrsmcgee1_ee474ea1:

    # "In English class, Mrs. McGee has us working on our essays in class again."
    "Durante la lezione di inglese, la signora McGee ci fa lavorare di nuovo sui nostri saggi in classe."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee1.rpy:14
translate italian mrsmcgee1_aaf24ec9:

    # "She walks around the room answering questions from any students and looking over their essays."
    "Si aggira per l’aula rispondendo alle domande degli studenti e dando un’occhiata ai loro saggi."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee1.rpy:17
translate italian mrsmcgee1_420a4be4:

    # "When she comes over and stands close to me, I freeze and stop writing what I was working on, all other thoughts drifting out of my head."
    "Quando si avvicina e si ferma vicino a me, mi blocco e smetto di scrivere quello su cui stavo lavorando, mentre tutti gli altri pensieri svaniscono dalla mia mente."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee1.rpy:20
translate italian mrsmcgee1_35f4dc88:

    # "She touches her hand gently against my back."
    "Mi sfiora delicatamente la schiena con la mano."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee1.rpy:21
translate italian mrsmcgee1_b00da5b8:

    # et "It's okay, keep writing. I'm just reading what you have so far."
    et "Va tutto bene, continua a scrivere. Sto solo leggendo quello che hai scritto finora."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee1.rpy:22
translate italian mrsmcgee1_ab6d893a:

    # "I try to keep writing, but I can't think of anything else besides her touch."
    "Cerco di continuare a scrivere, ma non riesco a pensare ad altro se non al suo tocco."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee1.rpy:25
translate italian mrsmcgee1_e8652fd7:

    # "Then she leans down and whispers in my ear."
    "Poi si china e mi sussurra all’orecchio."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee1.rpy:26
translate italian mrsmcgee1_3a804160:

    # et "You're doing great."
    et "Stai andando alla grande."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee1.rpy:27
translate italian mrsmcgee1_17560636:

    # et "Your essay is looking really good."
    et "Il tuo saggio sembra davvero ben scritto."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee1.rpy:28
translate italian mrsmcgee1_8c2b661c:

    # et "I can't wait to read the rest of it."
    et "Non vedo l’ora di leggere il resto."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee1.rpy:29
translate italian mrsmcgee1_e41d9ed8:

    # "It's amazing how she is able to make me hard just by her proximity, just by her breath near my ear."
    "È incredibile come riesca a farmi eccitare solo con la sua vicinanza, solo con il suo respiro vicino al mio orecchio."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee1.rpy:30
translate italian mrsmcgee1_de8b0af2:

    # "She doesn't have to say anything sexy. Her very nature exudes sex."
    "Non ha bisogno di dire nulla di sexy. La sua stessa essenza trasuda sensualità."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee1.rpy:33
translate italian mrsmcgee1_b37c130b:

    # "She continues walking around the room, but I notice her looking over at me more often than she did the other students."
    "Continua a camminare per l’aula, ma noto che mi lancia sguardi più spesso di quanto faccia con gli altri studenti."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee1.rpy:34
translate italian mrsmcgee1_54c6164b:

    # "I wonder if she is attracted to me like I am attracted to her."
    "Mi chiedo se sia attratta da me come io lo sono da lei."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee1.rpy:35
translate italian mrsmcgee1_dd91d32c:

    # "Because God, I want to fuck her so bad."
    "Perché, Dio mio, ho una voglia matta di scoparla."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee1.rpy:36
translate italian mrsmcgee1_f21fec0a:

    # "Eventually the day ends, and I leave school to go to work."
    "Alla fine la giornata finisce e lascio la scuola per andare al lavoro."

